                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This is a very small but useful dataset if you are ever looking to get jobs for a certain US city in LinkedIn. It contains a list of US cities and states and it's corresponding LinkedIn ID (which is usually externally hidden). </p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>The cities list was retreived from here: <a href=\"https://github.com/kelvins/US-Cities-Database\" target=\"_blank\">https://https://github.com/kelvins/US-Cities-Database</a> and the names of the ciiadjusted to match the name used in LinkedIn (which could differ in subtle ways).</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Some cities do not have an ID, this is because the city is either too small or because there was a difference in the name on LinkedIn which I did not detect (human error). If you ever run in to one of these feel free to enhance this dataset.</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
